        "id": "b1",
        "chapter_id": "ch1",
        "text": "Nera Sol and Neri Sol were two apprentices sharing a workbench. Nera was the older sister; Neri was her younger brother. They were siblings, not aliases for the same person.",
        "source": {
          "href": "text/ch1.xhtml",
          "element_id": "b1",
          "tag": "p"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "b2",
        "chapter_id": "ch1",
        "text": "Nera held a bell in her hands while Neri struck it with a wooden mallet. Each watched the other work. They entered two separate names in the attendance book: Nera Sol and Neri Sol.",
        "source": {
          "href": "text/ch1.xhtml",
          "element_id": "b2",
          "tag": "p"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "b3",
        "chapter_id": "ch2",
        "text": "The next morning Neri Sol arrived first. Nera Sol joined her brother a few minutes later. Both apprentices were present when the workshop opened.",
        "source": {
          "href": "text/ch2.xhtml",
          "element_id": "b3",
          "tag": "p"
        }
      }
